worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_product_search.js"
  ceiling 269
  rationale "Issues #800 and #872 product search, browser twin (issue #1188 JS parity). Mirrors rust/src/solver_handlers/product_search.rs: marketplaces, request cues, qualifier constraints and product nouns are read from data/seed/product-search-cues.lino, and the answer renders the English product_search_result template from multilingual-responses-product-search.lino exactly as the native handler does. JavaScript-first twin of native handler keys (product_search), added under R997-R999 (2026-10-06); growth is the ported handler, not silent regrowth. Ceiling moved 230 to 269 for issue #1173 R1173-3 (2026-10-08): the refusal lane for a product request with no marketplace (productSearchMarketplaceNeeded, twin of `marketplace_needed`), which names the catalogued marketplaces instead of guessing a store."
